                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Meyer to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Embassy of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Rome</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1902-12-18"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">December 18,
                    1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Meyer reports that Italy, while well disposed to arbitration, will be
                    governed in her action by the attitude of Germany and Great Britain.)</p>
            </div>
